// door_helper: the helper has arrived.
// Mid-plan resume: the claimed helper has arrived; a replan from the root keeps it (claimed first).
// method: behave
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !unlatch r2 d1
//   2. !hold_door r2 d1
//   3. !pass_door r1 d1 hall
//   4. !release_door r2 d1
//   5. !release r2
//   6. &fetch r1 box hall

self r1
robot r1
robot r2
door d1 hall room_a
door d1 room_a hall
route hall room_a room_a
route hall room_b room_a
route room_a hall hall
route room_a room_b room_b
route room_b room_a room_a
route room_b hall room_a
job fetch box hall
status r1 free
status r2 busy
claimed r2 r1
at r1 room_a
at r2 room_a
holding r1 box
door_type d1 spring
